},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: It looks like they've got Vrang with them. These bastards...",
["id"] = "s10_3411",
["timestamp"] = 1795493369,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: I thought you were dead, Terry.",
["id"] = "s10_3412",
["timestamp"] = 1795493382,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: No, Walt, I'm still alive. That shot you took at me back in Ratchet only missed my heart by an inch.",
["id"] = "s10_3413",
["timestamp"] = 1795493384,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Well, not much chance I'd miss at this range.",
["id"] = "s10_3414",
["timestamp"] = 1795493391,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: You might have failed to notice that you are outnumbered.",
["id"] = "s10_3415",
["timestamp"] = 1795493394,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Just so--no matter how fast these thugs are, my first shot is aimed at you.",
["id"] = "s10_3416",
["timestamp"] = 1795493398,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: It seems you've made some fast friends, Walt. This orc filth refused to give you up. If only he knew how little loyalty means to you.",
["id"] = "s10_3417",
["timestamp"] = 1795493403,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: It's not about loyalty. It's about honor. That orc knows more about honor than the Lord Admiral ever did. That's why I left.",
["id"] = "s10_3418",
["timestamp"] = 1795493411,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Listen to me, Terry, just take these men and leave. Tell Benedict or whomever sent you that I'm dead. Walk away.",
["id"] = "s10_3419",
["timestamp"] = 1795493418,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: I can't do that. You know what happens to deserters. Put your rifle down and come peacefully... or don't. The bounty is \"dead or alive\" and I still owe you for Ratchet.",
["id"] = "s10_3420",
["timestamp"] = 1795493424,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Dammit, Terry...",
["id"] = "s10_3421",
["timestamp"] = 1795493434,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink yells: Attack!",
["id"] = "s10_3422",
["timestamp"] = 1795493436,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul Tiras Marine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!",
["id"] = "s10_3423",
["timestamp"] = 1795493450,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul Tiras Marine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!",
["id"] = "s10_3424",
["timestamp"] = 1795493452,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul Tiras Marine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!",
["id"] = "s10_3425",
["timestamp"] = 1795493453,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Sorry if they roughed you up, Vrang. If I had known they got you, I'd have come running.",
["id"] = "s10_3426",
["timestamp"] = 1795493456,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vrang Wildgore",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vrang Wildgore says: Is it true--you deserted your brothers in arms?",
["id"] = "s10_3427",
["timestamp"] = 1795493462,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Yes, Vrang, it is true. When Daelin Proudmoore took control of Theramore, he did terrible things. Dishonorable things that I could not be a part of.",
["id"] = "s10_3428",
["timestamp"] = 1795493467,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vrang Wildgore",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vrang Wildgore says: I see. I can respect a man who values his honor and does not compromise his convictions.",
["id"] = "s10_3429",
["timestamp"] = 1795493475,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
