},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: You might have failed to notice that you are outnumbered.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586905,
["id"] = "s11_2502",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Just so--no matter how fast these thugs are, my first shot is aimed at you.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586909,
["id"] = "s11_2503",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: It seems you've made some fast friends, Walt. This orc filth refused to give you up. If only he knew how little loyalty means to you.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586914,
["id"] = "s11_2504",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: It's not about loyalty. It's about honor. That orc knows more about honor than the Lord Admiral ever did. That's why I left.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586921,
["id"] = "s11_2505",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Listen to me, Terry, just take these men and leave. Tell Benedict or whomever sent you that I'm dead. Walk away.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586928,
["id"] = "s11_2506",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: I can't do that. You know what happens to deserters. Put your rifle down and come peacefully... or don't. The bounty is \"dead or alive\" and I still owe you for Ratchet.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586935,
["id"] = "s11_2507",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Dammit, Terry...",
["timestamp"] = 1795586944,
["id"] = "s11_2508",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink yells: Attack!",
["timestamp"] = 1795586946,
["id"] = "s11_2509",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul Tiras Marine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!",
["timestamp"] = 1795586963,
["id"] = "s11_2510",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul Tiras Marine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!",
["timestamp"] = 1795586964,
["id"] = "s11_2511",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul Tiras Marine",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!",
["timestamp"] = 1795586965,
["id"] = "s11_2512",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Sorry if they roughed you up, Vrang. If I had known they got you, I'd have come running.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586969,
["id"] = "s11_2513",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Yes, Vrang, it is true. When Daelin Proudmoore took control of Theramore, he did terrible things. Dishonorable things that I could not be a part of.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586980,
["id"] = "s11_2514",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Thank you, Vrang.",
["timestamp"] = 1795586994,
["id"] = "s11_2515",
},
