y dear. Where's Alvarion? Too afraid to come and face Ferauu, so he sent you?\",\"id\":\"s0_4226\",\"timestamp\":1794365277},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonshaman Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"level\":10},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:253591::::::::10:1489:::::::::|h[Ripe Stormapple]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4227\",\"timestamp\":1794365281},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Alvarion? Oh he's still in the hills with the peacekeepers, clearing out the rest of your lackeys. I'm sure they'll be along any minute and would love to see you.\",\"id\":\"s0_4228\",\"timestamp\":1794365283},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon says: HA! A poor bluff! Ferauu has eyes and ears everywhere. I know that it's just you and this scrawny stranger here. You've had your fun putting down a few of my weaker recruits, but The Bludgeon is here now and the party is over. Time to pay up, with interest.\",\"id\":\"s0_4229\",\"timestamp\":1794365291},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hungry Bandit\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hungry Bandit attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s0_4230\",\"timestamp\":1794365294},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonshaman Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"level\":10},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:252028::::::::10:1489:::::::::|h[Fresh Gustberry Bread]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4231\",\"timestamp\":1794365297},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 19 Copper\",\"id\":\"s0_4232\",\"timestamp\":1794365298},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia raises her pitchfork, ready to fight.\",\"id\":\"s0_4233\",\"timestamp\":1794365305},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: I'm done talking. Stranger, thanks for everything...\",\"id\":\"s0_4234\",\"timestamp\":1794365308},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct yells: THREAT DETECTED. ADMINISTERING VIOLENCE.\",\"id\":\"s0_4235\",\"timestamp\":1794365311},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct yells: FUNCTION FULFILLED. RESUMING REST MODE.\",\"id\":\"s0_4236\",\"timestamp\":1794365318},{\"recor