PPEARANCE\",\"type\":\"COLLECTED_APPEARANCE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|cffff80ff|Htransmogappearance:302687|h[Peacekeeper's Mail]|h|r has been added to your appearance collection.\",\"timestamp\":1794377205,\"id\":\"s1_2614\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wait, yes... this crystal! Valennia, is this...\",\"timestamp\":1794377236,\"id\":\"s1_2615\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: ...a recall crystal! Used to record an important moment, no doubt.\",\"timestamp\":1794377240,\"id\":\"s1_2616\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: This is surely what the turncoat hoped to offer us in exchange for our protection.\",\"timestamp\":1794377244,\"id\":\"s1_2617\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: The recall crystal is badly damaged, though. The recording is likely to be incomplete, so we must listen carefully.\",\"timestamp\":1794377250,\"id\":\"s1_2618\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: Activate it, Valennia. We need to learn as much as we can about what it contains.\",\"timestamp\":1794377258,\"id\":\"s1_2619\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: ...do not delay. Muster our forces to march immediately. The pylons are key and...the wards...come down. This is...\",\"timestamp\":1794377265,\"id\":\"s1_2620\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: ...quickly. With our forces.....will be exposed.....my ritual must not....\",\"timestamp\":1794377274,\"id\":\"s1_2621\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: I alone am.....this task....the Windlord will.......our voices.....he will come.....we must not fail!\",\"timestamp\":1794377281,\"id\":\"s1_2622\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: The crystal is too damaged to play any further, I am afraid.\",\"timestamp\":1794377289,\"id\":\"s1_2623\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wards... what is this about wards, Valennia?\",\"timestamp\":1794377295,\"id\":\"s1_2624\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: The anchor pylons keep us suspended in this realm, but they also act as wards! The Shal'nan once spoke of this. They keep us shielded from...\",\"timestamp\":1794377299,\"id\":\"s1_2625\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: With the cult running roughshod over most of the island with impunity, Lorthuna undoubtedly thinks we are on the back foot. We can use that overconfidence against her.\",\"timestamp\":1794377301,\"id\":\"s1_2626\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Talaanis Shadowsong says: ...whatever else is out there in Skywall. Spirits save us... this is her plan. Bring down the wards and let her 'Windlord' in!\",\"timestamp\":1794377309,\"id\":\"s1_2627\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: I believe that with a proper distraction at the shrine, a small force of Peacekeepers, Windshapers, and High Order should be able to push up a flank and break into the inner sanctum. From there, we take out the High Priestess herself and cut the head off the snake.\",\"timestamp\":1794377310,\"id\":\"s1_2628\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valennia Stormfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valennia Stormfist says: Go and speak with the leaders of the Windshapers and the High Order, respectively. They don't get along, but I think they can recognize that the bigger threat is the Al'Aketh. Get them to agree to the plan and then return here.\",\"timestamp\":1794377325,\"id\":\"s1_2629\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Davoodoo Man\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":28},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1599:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001ok thats it for me tonight, have a good night chads.  C you tmrw\",\"timestamp\":1794377379,\"id\":\"s1_2630\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Sir Culation\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"level\":20},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sir Culation:1600:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaSir Culation|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001later\",\"timestamp\":1794377384,\"id\":\"s1_2631\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonshaman Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Simonshaman Windseeker:1602:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddSimonshaman Windseeker|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001gn\",\"timestamp\":1794377387,\"id\":\"s1_2632\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonshaman-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\