\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:263424::::::::9:1484::11:::::::|h[Wolfhide Belt]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3551\",\"timestamp\":1794463942},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:263491::::::::9:1484:::::::::|h[Shadowsong Family Signet]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3552\",\"timestamp\":1794463950},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:253152::::::::9:1484:::::::::|h[Aonda's Written Report]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3553\",\"timestamp\":1794463952},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Defense has increased to 41.\",\"id\":\"s1_3554\",\"timestamp\":1794464254},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather says: I tell you lot, that forest is haunted! I SAW *hic* WHAT I SAW!\",\"id\":\"s1_3555\",\"timestamp\":1794464414},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Donaal Downbreeze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Donaal Downbreeze says: Oh, enough of that crazy talk, swimmers. You are going to scare off the few customers we have with your drunken ghost stories!\",\"id\":\"s1_3556\",\"timestamp\":1794464419},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather says: If you don't believe me, go and see for yourself! Terrible windblown wraiths *hic*... forest spirits that will gnaw your ankles!\",\"id\":\"s1_3557\",\"timestamp\":1794464426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: My wife and I run the stormapple orchard in the lowlands, just to the west of Valanaar.\",\"id\":\"s1_3558\",\"timestamp\":1794464426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: Some years ago our farm was attacked by bandits. They took everything we had and left me bruised and bloody. The next season around the same time, they returned.\",\"id\":\"s1_3559\",\"timestamp\":1794464431},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sirocca \\\"Swimmers\\\" Starfeather says: There's even a terrible forest wraith! Dressed all in black and... evil looking! I tell you, it's a cursed place! *hic*\",\"id\":\"s1_3560\",\"timestamp\":1794464433},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: They took most of our harvest again, but this time the bandit leader--Ferauu \\\"the Bludgeon\\\" as he's known--told us that every season they'd return and take twice as much as the previous year.\",\"id\":\"s1_3561\",\"timestamp\":1794464439},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: We tried to petition the peacekeepers to come and help drive the bandits off, but they are stretched too thin just dealing with the cult and couldn't spare anyone.\",\"id\":\"s1_3562\",\"timestamp\":1794464450},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: This year our yield is light and we can't hope to give them what they expect. The best case is that they simply kill us quickly. It's more likely they take everything we have and leave us to starve.\",\"id\":\"s1_3563\",\"timestamp\":1794464459},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: I came to town to hire fighters to drive them off. I found one warrior who agreed to help, but he robbed me as soon as we were out of town and nearly beat me to death.\",\"id\":\"s1_3564\",\"timestamp\":1794464470},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alvarion Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alvarion Windfield says: At this point I'm too injured to leave this bed. I'm begging you, stranger. Travel to my orchard. Tell Aamelia what happened and help her survive this somehow. Please, stranger... help us.\",\"id\":\"s1_3565\",\"timestamp\":1794464479},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:263414::::::::9:1484::11:::::::|h[Traveler's Wraps]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3566\",\"timestamp\":1794464534},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Daggers has increased to 37.\",\"id\":\"s1_3567\",\"timestamp\":1794464567},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Daggers has increased to 38.\",\"id\":\"s1_3568\",\"timestamp\":1794464641},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Defense has increased to 42.\",\"id\":\"s1_3569\",\"timestamp\":1794464647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Daggers has increased to 39.\",\"id\":\"s1_3570\",\"timestamp\":1794464819},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: As you know, our way of life is in grave danger. Since the elementals vanished, our people have been in a state of steady decline.\",\"id\":\"s1_3571\",\"timestamp\":1794464954},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The Al'Aketh are a symptom of this. In many ways they are a dark mirror into the hearts of the Windshapers. Many of us believe that we are to blame for the spirits leaving us.\",\"id\":\"s1_3572\",\"timestamp\":1794464962},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Whatever the cause, we need to find a solution quickly before we tear ourselves apart. Tell me, what do you know of Kalimdor?\",\"id\":\"s1_3573\",\"timestamp\":1794464972},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Endaria Mistgaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Endaria Mistgaze says: Oh, and a word of warning before you head up to Shadowgale Forest. It's incredibly dangerous up there. Some even say it's haunted. Make sure you are prepared and well-equipped if you plan to make the trek.\",\"id\":\"s1_3574\",\"timestamp\":1794464973},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The cradle of our people is now part of an even larger world known as \\\"Azeroth\\\". There are those on Azeroth possessing a skysight so strong that they can pierce the heavens themselves to see beyond.\",\"id\":\"s1_3575\",\"timestamp\":1794464979},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Shamans, much like myself, but orders of magnitude more powerful. This power and their knowledge of the elemental planes is the key to our survival.\",\"id\":\"s1_3576\",\"timestamp\":1794464990},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: In my own clumsy searching throughout the planes for signs of our elemental benefactors, I stumbled upon them...\",\"id\":\"s1_3577\",\"timestamp\":1794464998},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: An entire order of visionaries just like the Windshapers called The Earthen Ring. One of their leaders, a shaman named Muln Earthfury, has shown me much.\",\"id\":\"s1_3578\",\"timestamp\":1794465005},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: I have seen the way. We must return to Kalimdor, confer with this Earthen Ring. They will help us master the skysight so that we may call our elemental patrons back home.\",\"id\":\"s1_3579\",\"timestamp\":1794465014},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: However, this journey will be dangerous. We need strong, able-bodied young shen'dorei to join us as we explore this massive new world. Those just like you, in fact.\",\"id\":\"s1_3580\",\"timestamp\":1794465023},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: You do not need to agree to this now. When the time comes, however, please consider joining us in our expedition. Until we speak again... may the winds guide your path.\",\"id\":\"s1_3581\",\"timestamp\":1794465032},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: This construct might as well be a paperweight. Someone stole some of its most important components.\",\"id\":\"s1_3582\",\"timestamp\":1794465086},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Replacement parts are hard to come by these days, with how few intact constructs we have left on the island.\",\"id\":\"s1_3583\",\"timestamp\":1794465092},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: If you want to try and find the components we need, I won't stop you, but it might require more than a little bit of scavenging.\",\"id\":\"s1_3584\",\"timestamp\":1794465098},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Shrieklings tend to hoard shiny things in their lairs, so it's possible some construct parts may have ended up in the shriekling cave just west of Valanaar.\",\"id\":\"s1_3585\",\"timestamp\":1794465106},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Constructs used to help us trawl Windsong Lake and when the pylons started to fail, many fell into the depths. There may be usable parts on the lakebed if you are up for a swim.\",\"id\":\"s1_3586\",\"timestamp\":1794465115},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riaani Nightwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riaani Nightwind says: Lastly, the bandit highwaymen common in the Gustberry Lowlands are known to hoard a variety of junk at their camps. Construct parts are likely to be found among such loot.\",\"id\":\"s1_3587\",\"timestamp\":1794465125},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Herbalism has increased to 36.\",\"id\":\"s1_3588\",\"timestamp\":1794465194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2447::::::::9:1484:::::::::|h[Peacebloom]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s1_3589\",\"timestamp\":1794465194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:4873::::::::9:1484:::::::::|h[Dry Hardened Barnacle]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3590\",\"timestamp\":1794465229},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Windsong Crawler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Windsong Crawler attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s1_3591\",\"timestamp\":1794465246},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:257941::::::::9:1484:::::::::|h[Windsong Crawler Meat]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3592\",\"timestamp\":1794465250},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2675::::::::9:1484:::::::::|h[Crawler Claw]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3593\",\"timestamp\":1794465250},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":9},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive lo