pts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s1_4298\",\"timestamp\":1794537712},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:159::::::::5:1485:::::::::|h[Refreshing Spring Water]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4299\",\"timestamp\":1794537713},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 6 Copper\",\"id\":\"s1_4300\",\"timestamp\":1794537714},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Skinning has increased to 35.\",\"id\":\"s1_4301\",\"timestamp\":1794537810},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2934::::::::5:1485:::::::::|h[Ruined Leather Scraps]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4302\",\"timestamp\":1794537811},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'Aketh Ambusher\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'Aketh Ambusher says: Submit to the will of the windlord and beg his forgiveness!\",\"id\":\"s1_4303\",\"timestamp\":1794537844},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'Aketh Ambusher\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'Aketh Ambusher says: For the glory of the windlord!\",\"id\":\"s1_4304\",\"timestamp\":1794537991},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Two-Handed Swords has increased to 19.\",\"id\":\"s1_4305\",\"timestamp\":1794538003},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Defense has increased to 24.\",\"id\":\"s1_4306\",\"timestamp\":1794538004},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'Aketh Ambusher\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'Aketh Ambusher attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s1_4307\",\"timestamp\":1794538004},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:1380::::::::5:1485:::::::::|h[Frayed Robe]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4308\",\"timestamp\":1794538007},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonhunter Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:4540::::::::5:1485:::::::::|h[Tough Hunk of Bread]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4309\",\"timestamp\":1794538007},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 15 Copper\",\"id\":\"s1_4310\",\"timestamp\":1794538008},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Go on and have a seat near the fire and we can get started.\",\"id\":\"s1_4311\",\"timestamp\":1794538078},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: All you need to start a camp of your own is a basic campfire. Cooks can generally teach you how to make one of those.\",\"id\":\"s1_4312\",\"timestamp\":1794538083},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.\",\"id\":\"s1_4313\",\"timestamp\":1794538091},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!\",\"id\":\"s1_4314\",\"timestamp\":1794538107},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.\",\"id\":\"s1_4315\",\"timestamp\":1794538109},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.\",\"id\":\"s1_4316\",\"timestamp\":1794538119},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Raan Wildwind\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Raan Wildwind says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.\",\"id\":\"s1_4317\",\"timestamp\":1794538128},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Cooking skill.\",\"id\":\"s1_4318\",\"timestamp\":1794538220},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Constable Aonda\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Constable Aonda says: If you are looking for more work, I'm sure there are some folks in town that are also looking for help with one task or another. Just ask around, you are bound to find something.\",\"id\":\"s1_4319\",\"timestamp\":1794538301},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Bows has increased to 25.\",\"id\":\"s1_4320\",\"timestamp\":1794538474},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"tex