\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Belathaan... I thought we agreed to meet alone? I'd hate to think you intended to ambush me here, in the shadow of my shrine.\",\"id\":\"s2_2816\",\"timestamp\":1794549796},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belathaan Brightwish\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belathaan Brightwish says: No, no! Lorthuna, you do not understand. This windshaper is merely passing by. They did not come here with me!\",\"id\":\"s2_2817\",\"timestamp\":1794549802},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: It matters not. I think that I'll just have my pets kill the both of you and send your tongue back to Elaadrin as a warning to keep his little mages in Valanaar, where they belong.\",\"id\":\"s2_2818\",\"timestamp\":1794549807},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belathaan Brightwish\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belathaan Brightwish says: Lorthuna, be reasonable. Elaadrin sent me to discuss a path to peace and...\",\"id\":\"s2_2819\",\"timestamp\":1794549816},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Enough. Goodbye, Belathaan and... whomever you are.\",\"id\":\"s2_2820\",\"timestamp\":1794549820},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonhunter-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.