 receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263329::::::::10:1491::11:::::::|h[Flutterfly Swatter]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s3_4410\",\"timestamp\":1794678199},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonwarrior Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"level\":10},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2455::::::::10:1491:::::::::|h[Minor Mana Potion]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s3_4411\",\"timestamp\":1794678199},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Alvarion? Oh he's still in the hills with the peacekeepers, clearing out the rest of your lackeys. I'm sure they'll be along any minute and would love to see you.\",\"id\":\"s3_4412\",\"timestamp\":1794678203},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ferauu the Bludgeon says: HA! A poor bluff! Ferauu has eyes and ears everywhere. I know that it's just you and this scrawny stranger here. You've had your fun putting down a few of my weaker recruits, but The Bludgeon is here now and the party is over. Time to pay up, with interest.\",\"id\":\"s3_4413\",\"timestamp\":1794678211},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia raises her pitchfork, ready to fight.\",\"id\":\"s3_4414\",\"timestamp\":1794678225},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simonwarrior Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"level\":10},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:4775::::::::10:1491:::::::::|h[Cracked Bill]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s3_4415\",\"timestamp\":1794678226},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: I'm done talking. Stranger, thanks for everything...\",\"id\":\"s3_4416\",\"timestamp\":1794678228},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct yells: THREAT DETECTED. ADMINISTERING VIOLENCE.\",\"id\":\"s3_4417\",\"timestamp\":1794678231},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct yells: FUNCTION FULFILLED. RESUMING REST MODE.\",\"id\":\"s3_4418\",\"timestamp\":1794678239},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aamelia Windfield\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aamelia Windfield says: Huh. Well that was... unexpected. I guess we know what that big lug's purpose is now. Let's head back to the house, stranger.\",\"id\":\"s3_4419\",\"timestamp\":1794678239},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarrior-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\