s Ear]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3685\",\"timestamp\":1794714646},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:267474::::::::14:1484:::::::::|h[Galeswept Forestshroom]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s4_3686\",\"timestamp\":1794714646},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 41 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_3687\",\"timestamp\":1794714647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:3013::::::::14:1484:::::::::|h[Scroll of Protection]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3688\",\"timestamp\":1794714688},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 7 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_3689\",\"timestamp\":1794714689},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Feral Combat has increased to 64.\",\"id\":\"s4_3690\",\"timestamp\":1794714760},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'Aketh Skypriest\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'Aketh Skypriest attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s4_3691\",\"timestamp\":1794714782},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:252031::::::::14:1484:::::::::|h[Crisp Spring Water]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3692\",\"timestamp\":1794714783},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 34 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_3693\",\"timestamp\":1794714784},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'Aketh Skypriest\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'Aketh Skypriest attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s4_3694\",\"timestamp\":1794714816},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:252031::::::::14:1484:::::::::|h[Crisp Spring Water]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3695\",\"timestamp\":1794714819},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2589::::::::14:1484:::::::::|h[Linen Cloth]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_3696\",\"timestamp\":1794714819},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 16 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_3697\",\"timestamp\":1794714820},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Simondruid, ensure any allies with you are prepared to fight, and speak with me when you are ready to confront Lorthuna.\",\"id\":\"s4_3698\",\"timestamp\":1794714873},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: We were hoping for more reinforcements, but this will have to do. Let's push forward!\",\"id\":\"s4_3699\",\"timestamp\":1794714876},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Ayessa... my former sister. How far you've fallen, keeping company with this High Order filth.\",\"id\":\"s4_3700\",\"timestamp\":1794714901},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Lorthuna! Stop this madness. You don't know what bringing down the wards protecting Zephras will do. You could doom us all!\",\"id\":\"s4_3701\",\"timestamp\":1794714906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Bring the wards down? The wards have been down for days, fools. No, I am merely lighting a beacon... for the true servants of Al'Akir to follow.\",\"id\":\"s4_3702\",\"timestamp\":1794714913},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: I'll make this easy for you, witch. Stop what you are doing now and I will make your death swift. This is the last and best offer you will get from the High Order.\",\"id\":\"s4_3703\",\"timestamp\":1794714921},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Empty threats, Elaadrin. Regardless of what happens to me now, my great work is done. Consider yourself lucky to be here at the eye of the storm, to witness the fruits of our labor.\",\"id\":\"s4_3704\",\"timestamp\":1794714930},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Ahh... yes! The call has been answered. Meet your end with joy!\",\"id\":\"s4_3705\",\"timestamp\":1794714940},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Who dares call the Lord of the East Wind?\",\"id\":\"s4_3706\",\"timestamp\":1794714948},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Wait... what is this place? How could such a place exist in the Windlord's realm?\",\"id\":\"s4_3707\",\"timestamp\":1794714953},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Wizard Fdr\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":24},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Wizard Fdr:959:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebWizard Fdr|r]|h: \\u0001GRM\\u0001simon give me 10g so i can reroll my legacy points\",\"id\":\"s4_3708\",\"timestamp\":1794714956},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: So the rumors were true. My wayward brothers did well to conceal this place from the gaze of Al'Akir.\",\"id\":\"s4_3709\",\"timestamp\":1794714959},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: Yes! Yes! It is by my will that the way to Zephras is open to you! Bring me before your Windlord so that he may know who was the herald of his glory!\",\"id\":\"s4_3710\",\"timestamp\":1794714967},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: You dare to command me, mortal? No, I think not. Begone, insignificant elf!\",\"id\":\"s4_3711\",\"timestamp\":1794714976},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Priestess Lorthuna says: No! Never, I would never dare!\",\"id\":\"s4_3712\",\"timestamp\":1794714980},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Well, you certainly never will again, insect. Hah!\",\"id\":\"s4_3713\",\"timestamp\":1794714982},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Enjoy your remaining time as \\\"guests\\\" in my lord's realm until his judgement inevitably arrives. You'll know not when, but it is coming.\",\"id\":\"s4_3714\",\"timestamp\":1794714985},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Now that this wondrous realm is no longer hidden from us, you are going to enjoy getting to know the TRUE children of Skywall...\",\"id\":\"s4_3715\",\"timestamp\":1794714993},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Defense has increased to 64.\",\"id\":\"s4_3716\",\"timestamp\":1794715006},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muln Earthfury\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Muln Earthfury says: Sorry that we are late, Ayessa.\",\"id\":\"s4_3717\",\"timestamp\":1794715035},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver says: It took a bit of work to convince Archmage Rhonin to help me open that transplanar portal...\",\"id\":\"s4_3718\",\"timestamp\":1794715039},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: Ansirem! This isn't how I expected our first meeting to go, but I'm glad you made it!\",\"id\":\"s4_3719\",\"timestamp\":1794715046},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Nor is this how I envisioned our first meeting, Muln.\",\"id\":\"s4_3720\",\"timestamp\":1794715051},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Well if this isn't an inspirational sight. The little elves seem to have friends in... low places.\",\"id\":\"s4_3721\",\"timestamp\":1794715054},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muln Earthfury\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Muln Earthfury says: We have no quarrel with you, Lord of the East Wind. Leave us in peace.\",\"id\":\"s4_3722\",\"timestamp\":1794715059},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rohash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rohash says: Very well, mortals. For now enjoy your respite. I simply cannot wait to tell the Windlord about all that has transpired here. You will be seeing me again... very soon.\",\"id\":\"s4_3723\",\"timestamp\":1794715063},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: I think it's time for us to be leaving this place. I will open a portal to Valanaar.\",\"id\":\"s4_3724\",\"timestamp\":1794715071},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring--the Windshapers would be happy to accept you as our guest.\",\"id\":\"s4_3725\",\"timestamp\":1794715075},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elaadrin Evengale\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elaadrin Evengale says: Yes, and you, Archmage Runeweaver. The High Order is eager to learn more of the Kirin Tor.\",\"id\":\"s4_3726\",\"timestamp\":1794715081},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Simondruid Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263405::::::::14:1484::11:::::::|h[Belt of Blades]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1794715184,\"id\":\"s4_3727\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simondruid-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Skyborne\",\"name\":\"Nite Form\",\"sex\":2,\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"level\":14},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nite Form:1048:TEXT_E